   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Testing-only workflow for the sweep harness; hidden from the template browser. Based on dgx-monarch-minimax-h3-guide, with only the changes needed for this test. A second Add Guide reads the first one's positive output, so two stills anchor at two frames at once. Add Guide appends to the keyframe list already on the conditioning, so a third would hold three, and each guide needs its own Load Image and its own frame_idx. 41 and 82 are 1.7 s and 3.4 s into a 124 frame clip at 24 fps, and the prompt puts a described beat at each. Keep every guide to one frame: on 2026-08-14 the video VAE encode before the guide took 13.6 GiB for one frame at this canvas and over 94 GiB for five, and two chained guides run that encode twice."
   ],
   "title": "DGX Monarch | MiniMax H3 with two guides in sequence"
  },
